 equation</p>
<ul>
<img src=3D"https://s0.wp.com/latex.php?latex=3Dx_1%2Bm_1+%5Ccdot+y+%5Cequi=
v+c_2+%5C+%28%5Ctext%7Bmod%7D+%5C+m_2%29+%5C+%5C+%5C+%5C+%5C+%5C+%5C+%5C+%5=
C+%5C+%5C+%5C+%5C+%5C+%5C+%5C+%5C+%5C+%5C+%5C+%5C+%5C+%5C+%5C+%5C+%5C+%5C+%=
