en <img src=3D"https://s0.wp.com/latex.php?latex=3Dy%3Dv_1+%5Ccdot+%28c_2-x=
_1%29&amp;bg=3Dffffff&amp;fg=3D333333&amp;s=3D0&amp;c=3D20201002" alt=3D"y=
=3Dv_1 \cdot (c_2-x_1)" class=3D"latex"> where <img src=3D"https://s0.wp.co=
